# ClaimLens Environment Configuration
# Optional: Google Fact Check Tools API Key
# If omitted, ClaimLens runs smoothly using its curated local evidence repository.
# To obtain a key:
# 1. Visit https://console.cloud.google.com/
# 2. Enable "Fact Check Tools API"
# 3. Create an API Key under Credentials
# 4. Copy this file to .env and set your key below:
GOOGLE_FACT_CHECK_API_KEY=
